            "text": "Authentication Rate-Limit Bypass in Dashboard Login via Spoofed Proxy Headers\n\nThe dashboard login endpoint derives its rate-limit key from client-supplied proxy headers, allowing an unauthenticated attacker to rotate `x-real-ip` values and bypass the login throttle. This removes the intended online guessing protection on the administrative login."
          },
