          "properties": {
            "security-severity": "3.7",
            "strix_vuln_class_hash": "97e1757a3f5277d95d4d4698c73a710b7f37e6433b8173e93d1976c9a3e4f397",
            "strix": {
              "id": "vuln-0003",
              "severity": "low",
              "cvss": 3.7,
              "timestamp": "2026-08-26 13:50:50 UTC",
              "target": "http://127.0.0.1:4321",
              "endpoint": "/dashboard/logout",
              "method": "POST",
              "cwe": "CWE-613",
              "impact": "An attacker who has obtained a valid `crm_session` cookie can continue accessing protected dashboard content after the legitimate user logs out. The demonstrated impact is continued unauthorized read access to CRM lead data exposed through `/dashboard/leads` and related protected dashboard routes until the session naturally expires.",
              "technical_analysis": "The dashboard session model is fully stateless. `src/lib/admin-session.ts` creates a token as `expiresAt.nonce.signature` and `verifyAdminSession()` only checks the HMAC and expiration timestamp:\n\n```typescript title=src/lib/admin-session.ts startLineNumber=19 endLineNumber=39\nexport const createAdminSession = () => {\n\tconst expiresAt = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) + ADMIN_SESSION_MAX_AGE;\n\tconst payload = `${expiresAt}.${randomBytes(24).toString(\"base64url\")}`;\n\n\treturn `${payload}.${sign(payload)}`;\n};\n\nexport const verifyAdminSession = (token?: string) => {\n\tif (!token) return false;\n\n\tconst parts = token.split(\".\");\n\tif (parts.length !== 3) return false;\n\n\tconst [expiresAt, nonce, signature] = parts;\n\tif (!/^\\d+$/.test(expiresAt) || !nonce || !signature) return false;\n\tif (Number(expiresAt) <= Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000)) return false;\n\n\tconst expected = Buffer.from(sign(`${expiresAt}.${nonce}`));\n\tconst received = Buffer.from(signature);\n\n\treturn expected.length === received.length && timingSafeEqual(expected, received);\n};\n```\n\n`src/pages/dashboard/logout.ts` only deletes the client cookie and never records revocation state:\n\n```typescript title=src/pages/dashboard/logout.ts startLineNumber=9 endLineNumber=16\ncookies.delete(\n  ADMIN_SESSION_COOKIE,\n  {\n    path: \"/dashboard\"\n  }\n);\n\nreturn redirect(\"/dashboard\", 303);\n```\n\n`src/middleware.ts` then continues to accept any copied token whose signature and expiration remain valid:\n\n```typescript title=src/middleware.ts startLineNumber=51 endLineNumber=55\nif (\n\tisDashboardRoute &&\n\t!PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_PATHS.has(pathname) &&\n\t!verifyAdminSession(context.cookies.get(ADMIN_SESSION_COOKIE)?.value)\n) {\n```\n\nBecause there is no server-side session registry or revocation check, logout is only a local browser cleanup action. Any previously copied cookie remains replayable until `ADMIN_SESSION_MAX_AGE` elapses.",
              "remediation_steps": "1. Replace the stateless dashboard cookie with a session model that has server-side revocation state.\n2. Register each issued session in a server-side store, keyed by a session identifier carried in the signed cookie.\n3. On logout, revoke that server-side record before deleting the browser cookie.\n4. In middleware, require both a valid signature and an active, non-revoked server-side session record before granting access to `/dashboard/*`.\n5. Fail closed when the session registry cannot be queried, and periodically purge expired session records.",
              "poc": {
                "description": "1. Authenticate to `/dashboard` with a valid administrator password and capture the issued `crm_session` cookie.\n2. Copy the cookie value aside before logging out.\n3. Request `/dashboard/leads` with the live cookie and confirm the protected page is accessible.\n4. Submit `POST /dashboard/logout` and observe that the active browser jar is cleared.\n5. Replay the copied pre-logout `crm_session` value in a fresh request to `/dashboard/leads`.\n6. Observe that the protected dashboard still returns `200 OK`, proving logout did not invalidate the issued session.",
                "script_available": true
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
